\begin{eqnarray*}
0.8x&=&x-49,400\\
0.8x-x&=&-49,400\\
0.2x&=&49,400
\end{eqnarray*}
So the price of the house is
\begin{equation*}
 x = 49,400/0.2 = 247,000.
\end{equation*}
<answer>Answer: $247,000</answer>

